  "details": "issue I have is I'm very light sensitive at times and the menu can be a bit bright same with the loading screen I don't want to have to pay to not be blinded every world swap or menu open\n\nso I hate subscriptions with a passion but it would be nice to have a basic dark and light mode so I don't have to turn on color blind mode on the menu to make it darker (it also removes color on peoples pictures)\n\n(i also tend to hang out in darker worlds because of my issues)",
